# SvelteKit / Svelte 5

`vitePlugin.dynamicCompileOptions` forces **`runes: true`** for all non-`node_modules` files. Use `$props()`, `$state()`, `$derived`, `$effect`. Do not use Svelte 4 `export let` or implicit reactivity.

## Files

- Pages: `+page.svelte` + optional `+page.server.ts` (`PageServerLoad` from `./$types`)
- Layout data: `src/routes/+layout.server.ts` returns `{ user, deployEnvironment }` via `getSessionUser`
- Auth-gated pages (`/dashboard`, `/settings`): `const { user } = await parent();` then `redirect(302, `/auth/signin?redirect=…`)`
- Secrets stay in `.server.ts` / `$env/dynamic/private`. Never `PUBLIC_WORKOS_*`

## Imports

- `$lib` → `src/lib`
- `$convex` → `src/convex` (custom alias in `svelte.config.js`)
- `$env/dynamic/public` | `private` — Vitest stubs these via `src/lib/test-stubs/`

## UI

Reuse `$lib/components/*` (`AppNav`, `AppFooter`, `MaterialIcon`, practice cards). Do not add shadcn/MUI. Icons: `MaterialIcon` + Material Symbols names. Fonts: `@fontsource-variable/.../wght.css` only — **never** `full.css`.

## Convex on the client

Root layout calls `setupConvex` only when `PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL` is set; otherwise the client is disabled. Browser JWT comes from `GET /api/auth/convex-token`. SSR practice/progress uses `$lib/convex.server.ts` with the WorkOS session token.

## CSP

`svelte.config.js` `kit.csp` is the source of truth. New third-party origins need a directive update (Convex, Sentry ingest, Vercel insights are already listed).
